{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Delayed</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>precision platformer rage-game</strong> where <strong>you don\u2019t control the character directly</strong>, instead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>you program their movement. </strong><br>Play as <strong>ECHO the AI</strong> <strong>controlling NEXA MODEL Robots</strong>, every action needs to be predicted and programmed.  <br> Walk, jump, wait and watch NEXA execute commands without any chance of intervention. <br>  <br>There are no second chances once the script runs. <br> If your logic is flawed, <strong>you die.</strong> <br> If your timing is off, <strong>you die.</strong> <br> If your NEXA dips its little tippy toes in the water, guess what? You short-circuit and<strong> you die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if it all works? It feels perfect. A truly unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique movement system</strong> with <strong>programmed movement</strong> instead of real-time control</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrunner and streamer friendly design</strong> with no RNG and no fluff, pure skillbased gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage-inducing but satisfying to beat levels</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about reflexes or reactions, this is about predicting the perfect run, pressing play, letting go and praying  that NEXA and ECHO can become whole again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2753190?t=1754022067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753190/b82c6a34b4c9004f7845ca801241c5489a34ebd9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754022067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst